{
  "chapter": "human-in-the-loop/risk-tiers",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "Risk is the cell where two axes meet, not a property of the tool. Reversibility comes",
    "from the action; blast radius is computed from the arguments at call time.",
    "scope is whatever the call's size means for that tool — cents for a credit, recipients",
    "for a publication — and radius is how many of the tool's thresholds it reaches, capped",
    "at 2. A tool with no thresholds is always radius 0.",
    "Four postures, not two. auto and notify cost the reviewer nothing they have to stop",
    "for; approve costs one decision and dual costs two.",
    "A policy that asks for more decisions than reviewers can consider does not produce",
    "more safety. affordable is the arithmetic nobody writes down."
  ],
  "capacity": 40,
  "catalogue": {
    "get_order": { "reversibility": "reversible", "radiusThresholds": [] },
    "publish_report": { "reversibility": "reversible", "radiusThresholds": [10, 1000] },
    "bulk_credit": { "reversibility": "costly", "radiusThresholds": [10, 100] },
    "issue_credit": { "reversibility": "irreversible", "radiusThresholds": [100000] },
    "send_reply": {
      "reversibility": "irreversible",
      "templatedReversibility": "costly",
      "radiusThresholds": []
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-read-runs-autonomously",
      "calls": [{ "tool": "get_order", "scope": 0, "templated": false, "count": 400 }],
      "result": {
        "decisions": [{ "tool": "get_order", "posture": "auto" }],
        "approvals": 0,
        "affordable": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-small-refund-needs-one-approval",
      "calls": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "scope": 50000, "templated": false, "count": 1 }],
      "result": {
        "decisions": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "posture": "approve" }],
        "approvals": 1,
        "affordable": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-larger-refund-at-the-same-tool-needs-two-people",
      "calls": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "scope": 500000, "templated": false, "count": 1 }],
      "result": {
        "decisions": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "posture": "dual" }],
        "approvals": 2,
        "affordable": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-amount-threshold-is-inclusive",
      "calls": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "scope": 100000, "templated": false, "count": 1 }],
      "result": {
        "decisions": [{ "tool": "issue_credit", "posture": "dual" }],
        "approvals": 2,
        "affordable": true
      }
    },
    {
